/**
 * Epic that initializes the {@link AlertMutedPeriodApplicationState} for the `Reliability.AssetDetailMuteSensorAlertsModal`
 * it takes the {@link Sensor} objects from payload. And sets {@link AlertMutedPeriodApplicationState#existingMutedPeriods}
 * or {@link AlertMutedPeriodApplicationState#newMutedPeriods} if the Sensor has existing muted periods or not.
 */
type AssetDetailMuteSensorPeriodsEpic mixes UiSdlEpic
